    {
      "id": "SCRIPT:ANGAngmarIntroText_01",
      "source": "WITCH-KING: Here, among these dark peaks, we will build a stronghold to bring ruin to the North Kingdom.",
      "source_hash": "9fae46a36760e202e36907c9f22523160627cff4b9e54191cf88bbd5a8865237",
      "entry_hash": "c786e2116d3db569caaf6e81650865e309b218c9dd52cab21fac6c17a6f52ea8",
      "protected_tokens": []
    },
    {
      "id": "SCRIPT:ANGAngmarIntroText_02",
      "source": "WITCH-KING: There is great evil in this place... especially the Black Numenoreans,\\n Men whose dark loyalties and fire for dominion we must rekindle.",
      "source_hash": "c61e0d2ef56bf7b7183bda019514fcf8287b48a86cf6f6dc13546504eb58a6a6",
      "entry_hash": "68d4d225e13148636d6716881788c1f052142fb852192954467d9a54a4649a8e",
      "protected_tokens": [
        "\\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SCRIPT:ANGAngmarIntroText_03",
      "source": "WITCH-KING: What's this? A warrior Troll, who fights like a trained swordsman? He would make a useful servant indeed!",
      "source_hash": "68c27f5d335a069299f8fab248f79922527863d341d4ef60c4941e0aec1e3fb1",
      "entry_hash": "ad2652a4a9bfa3db90283d8715c5f840f6b78cc812a001fcd4d2c9d358d610ab",
      "protected_tokens": []
    },
    {
      "id": "SCRIPT:ANGAngmarObjectiveText_01",
      "source": "The Witch-king must survive.",
      "source_hash": "1f3dd0ec0ae80e47f52bae8c8a02f6f7c313f7933bd81b23078ee85114f47ebe",
      "entry_hash": "3e26a943398a104d3ece2e382352627050c251a5bb8e962874d6ad7e6d82a81b",
      "protected_tokens": []
    },
    {
      "id": "SCRIPT:ANGAngmarObjectiveText_02",
      "source": "Morgomir must survive.",
      "source_hash": "55acdf1618b4ec422cc8442596ce9213770fc3800831f10801cb58b2a9d6c9c4",
      "entry_hash": "19ad4b4cdc02c8fa05485a4a2c25bf77004fd61f5bfcbd8f61eb42b4a6424bcf",
      "protected_tokens": []
    },
    {
      "id": "SCRIPT:ANGAngmarObjectiveText_03",
      "source": "Help the mysterious warrior Troll defeat his attackers.",
      "source_hash": "61312ea7bd5abc3c613a51fa3d5f168e5e4e9bb93516349459af75064ca5a749",
      "entry_hash": "06ef091c7411d9a5b512dd5c08cbfa4bc29f0c7d91bcb66adcd2dd6a256a470f",
      "protected_tokens": []
    },
    {
      "id": "SCRIPT:ANGAngmarObjectiveText_04",
      "source": "Rogash must survive.",
      "source_hash": "59da6ab98eb5114209a106cd46a005b6d0d5d1e0555a8751bed1c74135244340",
      "entry_hash": "45d4ea3ffa7f3e39ca06e9a7e4e5cf39937894aa0255ee878445347d05d6948d",
      "protected_tokens": []
    },
